{
  "description": "abysshub publish on a folder that shows its faults on its own, and a key without Manage Widgets: before any request that changes a Widget, it prints every fault in one run, each with its code, and exits non-zero. The folder has no run.py and no requirements.txt; the Publish File has no title and no tag, and its thumbnail names no image file; the Test Inputs name a Field that interface.json does not have, leave out a required Field that has no default, and give a file Field a path outside the folder and a path to no file. The key is read with GET /v1/key, and nothing else is sent.",
